; bfsodium SHA_256 ROUND : one round of the compression function
;
; HAND WRITTEN skeleton; The rotate  the exclusive or  the and and the adder
; are each PASTED from their own verified files; what is here is the wiring
; that FIPS 180_4 section 6 point 2 point 2 lays down and nothing else;
;
; INTERFACE entry=39 exit=0 footprint=0:188
; IO  in:  v{8} LE  Wt{4} LE  Kt{4} LE      (40 bytes)
;     out: v{8} LE                          (32 bytes)
;
; TAPE MAP  (home @0)
;   @0x00:0x1f  v{8}   u32 LE  a b c d e f g h  in and out
;   @0x20:0x23  Wt{4}  u32 LE  this round's schedule word; SPENT
;   @0x24:0x27  Kt{4}  u32 LE  this round's constant; SPENT
;   @0x28:0x2b  T1{4}  u32 LE
;   @0x2c:0x2f  T2{4}  u32 LE
;   @0x30:0x47  five scratch words and the temp a copy hands back through
;   @0x50:0x63  the adder frame; add32 footprint 0:19 at @0x50
;   @0x70:0x89  the exclusive or frame; xor32 0:25 at @0x70
;   @0x90:0xa9  the and frame; and32 0:25 at @0x90
;   @0xb0:0xbc  the rotate frame; rotr32 0:12 at @0xb0
;
; The round is
;   T1 = h plus Sigma1(e) plus Ch(e f g) plus Kt plus Wt
;   T2 = Sigma0(a) plus Maj(a b c)
;   h g f e d c b a  becomes  g f e (d plus T1) c b a (T1 plus T2)
; and that last line is a CONVEYOR: the whole array shifts one word down and
; then two words are written; no variable is ever addressed by name;
;
; Ch is written  g xor (e and (f xor g))  and Maj  (a and b) xor (a and c) xor
; (b and c)  so between and32 and xor32 there is no need for a NOT;

,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>   ; read a b c d e f g h  then Wt  then Kt
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,                                          ; continued
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=39
                                                               ; ASSERT zero 40:188

